<section class="bl-hero"><div class="bl-w bl-hero-g"><div class="bl-sun"><div class="bl-sun-t"><p class="bl-k">the easy-going jacket</p><h1>Loose on top, gathered at the waist.</h1></div></div><div class="bl-hero-r"><figure class="bl-tv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773848090001-e8245ee48957?auto=format&fit=crop&w=560&h=440&q=75" alt="a young man in a jacket against a colourful wall" width="560" height="440" fetchpriority="high"></figure><p class="bl-lead">Blouson is an independent guide to the blouson jacket: the roomy, waist-gathered jacket that &ldquo;blouses&rdquo; over its hem. Learn how it differs from its cousins, how to balance the proportions and which colours work.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="bl-s"><div class="bl-w bl-anat"><div class="bl-jk"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 340" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M110 50l-58 26-30 170 36 8 22-118v170h200V136l22 118 36-8-30-170-58-26-30 14h-60z" fill="#C1502E"/><path d="M120 50q60 30 120 0" fill="none" stroke="#3D2B1F" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M80 248q100-28 200 0" fill="none" stroke="#3D2B1F" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><path d="M80 300h200l-6 24H86z" fill="#3D2B1F"/><path d="M88 300q12-8 24 0t24 0 24 0 24 0 24 0 24 0 24 0 24 0" fill="none" stroke="#E3A72F" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M180 64v236" stroke="#3D2B1F" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M22 246l36 8-4 18-34-8z" fill="#3D2B1F"/><path d="M338 246l-36 8 4 18 34-8z" fill="#3D2B1F"/></svg>
<span class="bl-cl" style="left:50%;top:10%">1</span><span class="bl-cl" style="left:22%;top:42%">2</span><span class="bl-cl" style="left:72%;top:76%">3</span><span class="bl-cl" style="left:6%;top:78%">4</span></div><div><p class="bl-k">anatomy of a blouson</p><h2>What makes it a blouson?</h2><ol class="bl-al"><li><b>Easy collar.</b> Shirt, funnel or stand collar; often a soft drape.</li><li><b>Roomy body.</b> Cut fuller than the waist so it puffs, or &ldquo;blouses&rdquo;, above the hem.</li><li><b>Gathered hem.</b> An elastic, drawcord or rib waistband pulls it in at the hips.</li><li><b>Fitted cuffs.</b> Elastic or buttoned cuffs echo the gathered waist.</li></ol></div></div></section>

<section class="bl-s bl-mus"><div class="bl-w"><p class="bl-k">the family album</p><h2>Blouson and its cousins</h2><div class="bl-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Jacket types"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-t="0">Blouson</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-t="1">Bomber</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-t="2">Harrington</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-t="3">Trucker</button></div><div class="bl-fam"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 240" aria-hidden="true"><path id="fm-b" d="" fill="#1F6F6B"/><path id="fm-h" d="" fill="#3D2B1F"/><path id="fm-c" d="" fill="none" stroke="#3D2B1F" stroke-width="5"/></svg><div id="fm-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="bl-s" id="mixer"><div class="bl-w bl-mx"><div><p class="bl-k">proportion mixer</p><h2>Balance the look</h2><p>A blouson adds volume up top. Mix the parts and see how the silhouette changes.</p><div class="bl-sel"><label for="mx-j">Jacket length<select id="mx-j"><option value="0">Cropped (above waist)</option><option value="1" selected>Waist</option><option value="2">Hip</option></select></label><label for="mx-t">Trousers<select id="mx-t"><option value="0">Slim</option><option value="1" selected>Straight</option><option value="2">Wide</option></select></label><label for="mx-s">Shoes<select id="mx-s"><option value="0">Slim (loafers, plimsolls)</option><option value="1" selected>Trainers</option><option value="2">Chunky boots</option></select></label></div><div class="bl-vd" id="mx-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div><div class="bl-fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 420" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="100" cy="36" r="22" fill="#E8C9A6"/><path id="mx-jk" d="" fill="#C1502E"/><path id="mx-tr" d="" fill="#1F6F6B"/><path id="mx-sh" d="" fill="#3D2B1F"/></svg></div></div></section>

<section class="bl-s bl-teal"><div class="bl-w"><p class="bl-k">the lookbook</p><h2>Four ways people wear it</h2><div class="bl-look"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794859491757-f9238a8f3501?auto=format&fit=crop&w=340&h=440&q=75" alt="a woman with long red hair in a brown jacket in an autumn park" width="340" height="440" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Autumn in the park</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764722755916-4790de243953?auto=format&fit=crop&w=340&h=440&q=75" alt="a woman in sunglasses and a patterned jacket" width="340" height="440" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Pattern on pattern</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773293470322-91290aef42a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=340&h=440&q=75" alt="a person wearing a colourful patterned jacket outdoors" width="340" height="440" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Bright and easy</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1795001197273-c8dd68484803?auto=format&fit=crop&w=340&h=440&q=75" alt="a person wearing an off-the-shoulder beige jacket" width="340" height="440" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Off the shoulder</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="bl-s" id="palette"><div class="bl-w bl-pal"><div><p class="bl-k">colour matcher</p><h2>Pick your jacket colour</h2><div class="bl-sw" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Jacket colour"><label><input type="radio" name="jc" value="0" checked><span style="background:#C1502E">Rust</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="jc" value="1"><span style="background:#E3A72F">Mustard</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="jc" value="2"><span style="background:#1F6F6B">Teal</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="jc" value="3"><span style="background:#6B7A3C">Olive</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="jc" value="4"><span style="background:#E9DCC4;color:#3D2B1F">Stone</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="jc" value="5"><span style="background:#1E2A44">Navy</span></label></div><div class="bl-pal-o" id="pc-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div><figure class="bl-tv bl-tv2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1780856473943-28877e35eb26?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=380&q=75" alt="a woman in a patterned suit sitting on a ladder in sunlight" width="480" height="380" loading="lazy"></figure></div></section>

